People keep making suggestions as to what v3.1 should, or should not
contain. Well, I reckon v3.1 ought to be a multi-user version. Now, I'm
not a programmer, so don't ask me how to do it, but I'm sure many people
will agree that it would be fab if we could fight real people, as opposed
to monsters and occasionally ghosts.

I'm not criticising the current version of nethack, but when I compare far
simpler multi-user games (simpler from the view of the user), and a 
theoretical multi-user version of nethack, nethack would certainly win.
(Though I haven't had a chance to play TinyMUD; only MIST and MUD at Essex)
 
I wonder what other people think of this idea??

